    <p>
      <b>Description</b>
    </p>
    <p>The Quarter Gauge block shows the value of the bound signal on a quarter-circle (90 degree) scale between the configured limits.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Ports</b>
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Input(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no input ports.</p>
    <p>
      <b>Output(s)</b>
    </p>
    <p>This block declares no output ports.</p>
